  itemDescription: "Advanced Diagnostic and Therapeutic Institute  Biocontrol of
    Dengue Fever  This institute specializes in developing cutting-edge diagnostic
    tools and therapies. Its mission covers research on advanced imaging, diagnostic
    assays, and therapeutic innovations (including gene therapy, nanomedicine, and
    targeted drug delivery). The institute\u2019s focus areas range from early disease
    detection (e.g. cancer biomarkers, nanodiagnostics) to novel treatments such
    as bio-therapeutics and personalized medicine approaches. By combining diagnostics
    and therapeutics (\u201Ctheranostics\u201D), the institute aims to significantly
    improve patient outcomes through earlier intervention and more effective, tailored
    treatments"
